      "text": "The Coast Guard is securing America’s future on the Arctic frontier! As the nation’s sole operator of polar icebreakers, we're advancing maritime dominance in the Arctic– a region with a $3 billion seafood industry, $1 trillion in rare earth minerals, and a strategic position vital to our national sovereignty. Through Force Design 2028, we’re modernizing our capabilities to safeguard Alaska’s borders and Arctic maritime approaches, unlocking opportunities for generations!   \n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 #FinestMilitary #Arctic\n\n@USCGArctic @DHSgov",
