      "text": "Coast Guard cyber experts are leading the charge in maritime cybersecurity! At DEFCON, they shared critical insights on risks posed by Chinese-made ship-to-shore cranes and their impact on U.S. ports and infrastructure. \n \nWith strategies to mitigate threats and safeguard the maritime domain, @USCG continues our operations to control, secure, and defend America’s ports, waterways, and shipping from a wide range of threats—including those in cyberspace. Proud to stand alongside top cybersecurity professionals to protect the Nation’s supply chain. \n \nSemper Paratus—Always Ready.\n\nFollow us on LinkedIn to learn more: https://t.co/XPFUcTXqF2\n\n#uscg #Cybersecurity \n@DHSgov",
